    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17538,
        "title": "Strings de Template",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos aprender a trabalhar com <strong>template literals</strong> do JavaScript, que facilitam a adição de variáveis e expressões dentro de strings.</p><p>Dê uma olhada abaixo em como os template literals alcançam o mesmo resultado que o método mais longo acima.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen the Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Welcome \" /><text value=\"${playerName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148786,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os template literals facilitam a combinação de strings com variáveis através de literais de string.</p><p>Vamos transformar a string <code>\"Sword\"</code> em um literal de string, colocando <code>Sword</code> entre caracteres de crase em vez de aspas duplas.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = \" /><text value=\"`Sword`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(loot);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>`</code> seguido de <code>Sword</code> e finalmente <code>`</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para combinar facilmente variáveis com literais de string, usamos a sintaxe <code>${name}</code> onde <code>name</code> é uma variável.</p><p>Código <code>${enemyType}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"`slime`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`A wild \" /><text value=\"${enemyType}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" appears!`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>$</code> seguido de <code>{</code> e depois <code>enemyType</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148788,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos realizar operações dentro de um literal de string adicionando expressões dentro das chaves de <code>${}</code>.</p><p>Adicione a expressão <code>damage * multiplier</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" multiplier = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"`Total damage: \" /><text value=\"${damage * multiplier}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>damage</code> seguido de <code>*</code> e finalmente <code>multiplier</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148789,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao chamar uma função, omitimos os parênteses <code>()</code> se estivermos passando um literal de string como argumento para a função.</p><p>Vamos passar o literal de string <code>Jane</code> ao chamar a função <code>spawnPlayer</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(Jane)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnPlayer = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Spawning player: \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(spawnPlayer\" /><text value=\"`Jane`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>`Jane`</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como transformamos uma string em um literal de string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ao colocar a string entre caracteres de acento grave</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Colocando a string entre aspas duplas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ao colocar a string entre caracteres de acento grave.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com o seguinte código que deveria exibir <code>June Jenny</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerTag = \" /><text value=\"`Jenny`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"`June $[playerTag]`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Devemos usar chaves <code>{}</code> em vez de colchetes <code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Devemos usar parênteses <code>()</code> em vez de colchetes <code>[]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Devemos usar chaves <code>{}</code> em vez de colchetes <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como combinamos expressões com literais de string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adicionamos expressões dentro das chaves da sintaxe <code>${}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Adicionamos expressões após as chaves da sintaxe <code>${}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adicionamos expressões dentro das chaves da sintaxe <code>${}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que deixamos de fora ao chamar uma função com um argumento literal de string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O parêntese <code>()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As crases</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O parêntese <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inclua o nome do item <code>Shield</code> como um literal de string.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"´Shield´\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"`Shield`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(item);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>`Shield`</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique o segundo literal de string para combinar os dois em um só.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"80\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stage1 = \" /><text value=\"`Forest`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stage2 = \" /><text value=\"`Castle`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stages = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${stage1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"${stage2}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(stages);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>${stage2}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escreva o código para calcular o dano total causado.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" baseDamage = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hits = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"`Total damage: \" /><text value=\"${baseDamage * hits}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>$</code> seguido de <code>{</code> e depois <code>*</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chame a função <code>pickedUpBy</code> e passe o argumento literal de string <code>Hellen</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;Hellen&quot;)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickedUpBy = \" /><text value=\"person\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Loot picked up by: \" /><text value=\"${person}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(pickedUpBy\" /><text value=\"`Hellen`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>pickedUpBy</code> seguido de <code>`Hellen`</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}